{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_04_end","storyGroup":"act39side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act39side_level_act39side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EP-4","storyName":"重逢不乏意外","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"营地中船员们因为物资匮乏而人心惶惶，哈维尔想要带领船员归顺镇子。安纳斯塔西奥也对雅隆镇生出了一些不应该拥有的想法。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act39side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["极境","伊西多","门外的船员","好奇的船员","探头的船员","好奇的路人","不屑的路人","小伊西多","冷漠的路人","害羞的孩子","好心的路人","帕斯卡拉","饥饿的船员","习武教士","西尔弗","安纳斯塔西奥","满足的船员","胡安娜","哈维尔"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_bg_57_g12_alchemyworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"胳膊和腿都还在，脸也没有破相，就是更黑了点……","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"真是太好了！你不知道我听说他们这些强盗冷血无情、杀人如麻的时候，我有多紧张！","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"……你这都是从哪里听来的……","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"我是付出了多大的勇气才敢跑到这里来救你的啊！温蒂还留在镇子里，我这就给她……","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"……","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"（小声）等准备好了，我就给她发通讯，然后想办法离开这里！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我试过了，逃不出去的，而且，短期内我不打算离开。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#5$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"为什么？难道你真如传言一般加入了强盗的船队？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#2$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"（小声）老实告诉我，你真觉得在这穷乡僻壤当强盗很有前途吗？","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"……我对当海盗不感兴趣，极境。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我留下是因为……我想重拾当年自己逃避掉的炼金研究。这可是搭载了心相原质的罗盘……可能就只有这一枚存世了。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"而且……我答应了他们要修好罗盘。没有罗盘，他们很难继续活下去。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#2$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"那……你以后也打算一直跟他们走？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"不，等到罗盘修好，这些海盗就会离开盐漠，驶向大海。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我会留下来，继续在伊比利亚精进自己的剑术与炼金技艺。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"all","text":"","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slapcloth_light","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"极境拍了拍伊西多的肩膀，感觉自己的朋友似乎变了一些。","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"看来这段日子你有很多感触啊……也好。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"对了，外面那个小丫头叫我过来本来是要干什么来着？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我修复罗盘的过程中，需要有人帮忙做些辅助操作。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"那简单，就和在罗德岛一样，有什么需要帮忙的就和我说。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"嗯。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我会叫你。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"charslot","id":57},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多走到塑金台前站定，他手中施术用的探针在空气中划出锐响，精密的法术能量场沿着探针的轨迹逐渐成型。","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"他小心翼翼地拆下罗盘的外壳，将它送上塑金台。慢慢地，罗盘内原本凝固的流体物质，也开始随着法术能量流动的方向漾起波澜。","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"法术能量与心相原质交相辉映，淡金色的光透过工坊的缝隙，照亮了船外的盐地。","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"船员们没见过这样的景象，一个又一个地被吸引而来。","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门外的船员","text":"他们在搞什么东西？","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的船员","text":"是那个外面来的小子在搞什么炼啥术……这金光还挺有意思的。","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"探头的船员","text":"让我看看让我看看……","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"……","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"当真，还挺酷的。你手里的这是什么？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":78},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_bg_57_g14_ibtown_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":80},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":81,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_459_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_461_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_461_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的路人","text":"看，那孩子手里是什么？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_461_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_459_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不屑的路人","text":"还能有什么，又一个小鬼为了讨饭耍的把戏呗。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_459_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_461_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的路人","text":"那算了，赶紧走吧，我们可没有多余的口粮。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_461_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_459_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不屑的路人","text":"惹人烦的小鬼……","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_459_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":96},{"type":"charslot","fadetime":"1.5","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"戏法表演！只要一块饼就能观赏，诸位请不要错——","id":99},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_178","duration":"1.5","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"1","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"dialog","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"0.51","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"none","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"呜……","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_178","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷漠的路人","text":"别挡在路中间，到一边去。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":116},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":117},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"（小声）呸，混蛋……","id":119},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":125},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_bg_57_g12_alchemyworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"……","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"呃，外面围了好多人，会打扰你吗？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"我去把他们赶走？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"没事，有你在这叨叨，我感觉像是回到了之前在罗德岛的工作环境。他们打扰不到我的。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多没有停下手中的动作，他手中的探针仿佛在与能量场中荡漾的心相原质舞蹈。","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"光芒自他的掌心诞生，在窗外的船员们眼中，像是一场在干渴与饥饿中突然出现的白日梦境。","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门外的船员","text":"你见过这玩意吗？这小子还真会啊。","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的船员","text":"很久之前好像首领讲过差不多的故事，说大的城镇里有变戏法的，看起来就是这样。","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"探头的船员","text":"好看……","id":145},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"他们想看就让他们看吧，只要别突然冲进来要把我绑了送出去换吃的就行。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"……确实是他们能干出来的事。唉，人咋能这样？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"……大家都没有吃的就会这样。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":160},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_bg_57_g14_ibtown_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害羞的孩子","text":"哥哥……","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"你有吃的吗？","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害羞的孩子","text":"没……没有，我把我的丝带给你好吗？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"不行，你得拿吃的来换。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_700_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害羞的孩子","text":"我自己也没有吃的……我……","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"charslot","id":178},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好心的路人","text":"我这里有几块饼干，给这位小妹妹表演一次吧。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"饼干？好吧，既然您要求了，当然可以。","id":184},{"type":"dialog","id":185},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"charslot","id":188},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_57_i02.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":189},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"40","block":"false","id":190},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":191},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"2.5","keep":"true","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":193},{"type":"text","text":"在小伊西多的掌心，金属开始流淌，在黑暗中变幻着色彩。","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"街边的路人不由自主地凑了上来，他们嘴上嫌弃地骂着，可眼睛却不曾离开少年手中的流光。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"太久了，这破败的街道上太久没有出现过这样光亮的事物了。","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害羞的孩子","text":"真美啊，我可以靠近些看吗？","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"随便你。","id":198},{"type":"text","text":"少年手指挥动，流淌的金属化作一只羽兽飞向高空，转眼间又化作一尾鳞跃回掌心，化作鼷兽，化作驮兽……","id":199},{"type":"text","text":"映着流光的金属驮兽在人群中肆意奔跑，留下仿若星光的碎屑在空中飘散。","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的路人","text":"哇！","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不屑的路人","text":"不过是……","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的路人","text":"快闭嘴，好好看着吧。","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷漠的路人","text":"上一次看到烟花是什么时候……","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷漠的路人","text":"好像……有很久很久了……","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害羞的孩子","text":"烟花？什么是烟花？","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"围观的孩子鼓足了勇气伸出手来，接住一粒飘落的星光，自指尖传来的温暖让她不禁颤抖。","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好心的路人","text":"真是厉害的小家伙，你让这里的人难得地露出了笑容。","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"我只是为口吃的罢了。","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好心的路人","text":"啊……是吗？","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好心的路人","text":"那你自己又为何而展露笑容呢，孩子？","id":211},{"type":"dialog","id":212},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"charslot","id":217},{"type":"image","id":218},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_bg_57_g12_alchemyworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":220},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":222},{"type":"text","text":"探针牵引着心相原质，让它流淌作一条星河，在空气中蜿蜒。","id":223},{"type":"text","text":"船员们越聚越多，窗户上挤满了大大小小的脸。那些因饥渴劳累而灰败的脸，此刻都因伊西多手中的光芒而有了色彩。","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"兄弟，你这是不是有点表演性质了。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"别以为我看不出来！","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"……","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"刚才只是检验一下炼金设施和罗盘的状态，现在才该正式从心相原质里分离出那些锈蚀变质了的成分。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"这是我答应他们的……我能做到的。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"charslot","id":238},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_bg_57_g6_olddeck_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#8$1","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":241},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":242,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2.5","isblock":"false","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"false","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"哎，你们怎么聊了这么久？","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"我们这么久没见面，当然有很多话要聊啊，老板，你不会一直坐在这里等我吧？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"叫什么老板，太客气了，叫我小毛毛吧，我的朋友都这么叫我。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"你现在又要和我以朋友相称吗？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"对啊，要不是我这个朋友尽心帮你，你怎么找得到自己的老相识嘛。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#12$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","afrom":"0","ato":"0","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"l","iscopy":"true","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"200,-30","posto":"280,-30","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","duration":"0.7","focus":"l","end":"true","iscopy":"true","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"（你这丫头是真会颠倒黑白。）","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"280,-30","posto":"200,-30","afrom":"0.7","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","focus":"l","end":"true","iscopy":"true","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"让我想想啊……作为朋友你该叫我什么呢？","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"叫什么不都是一嘴皮的事情，你想要我怎么叫都可以！重要的是，那位伊西多大人怎么说？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"他愿不愿意帮帮忙，罩着点我？","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"哎呀，聊得太晚，忘记了。不过你要是嘴甜一点，说不定我明天就能想起来了。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"求求你了，尊敬的小红毛大人！超级厉害的黎博利！以及世上最最最帅的大帅哥！","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"不错，爱听，多讲几句！","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#13$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","afrom":"0","ato":"0","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","focus":"l","iscopy":"true","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-200,-30","posto":"-280,-30","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","duration":"0.7","focus":"l","end":"true","iscopy":"true","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（啊，可恶，你个傻鸟！）","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（敢这么要挟我，迟早揪了你那撮红毛！）","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-280,-30","posto":"-200,-30","afrom":"0.7","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","focus":"l","end":"true","iscopy":"true","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"……","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"算啦，算啦。看在你带着我找到了我的朋友……","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"charslot","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"极境伸手拍了拍眼前这个个子小小，说话和做事却十分老成，甚至堪称狠毒的小丫头。","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"你年纪这么小，就要在这强盗窝里打拼，要是真有什么解决不了的大事，就来找我吧。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"我心地可是很不错的哦！","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#14$1","focus":"l","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"……欸？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"……欸？？","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#15$1","focus":"l","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"呸，我才不信你！在这里说什么大话！","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"要做什么，还是得靠我自己！","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_bg_bg_ibbar.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":318},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":319,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"饥饿的船员","text":"再给我一块，谢谢。","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"……","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"charslot","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"饥饿的船员","text":"那种饼……唔……再、再来一盘！","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"（小声）他们这辈子是没吃过饭吗？","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"（小声）您不觉得熟悉吗？这副飞扬跋扈地索取的模样。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"（小声）这与他们当初劫掠您的粮仓时，有任何不同吗？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"（小声）我不需要他们有什么改变。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"咳咳……虽然我相信诸位已经来过雅隆镇许多次了，以一种并不那么和睦的方式……","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"但我还是欢迎你们的到来，并且对接下来要谈的事务满怀期待。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满足的船员","text":"呃嗝——","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满足的船员","text":"（举起手臂）","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"你是需要手帕吗？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满足的船员","text":"不用了，我有袖子。","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"啊……也好。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"（小声）呃……谁做的蒜油饼……","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"（小声）您甚至真的相信，您自己能接受他们吗？","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"（小声）如果这样能为镇子带来好处的话。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"既然诸位已经吃饱，我们也该谈谈——","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满足的船员","text":"你再去给我们整点饼，我要带回去。","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"用餐时间已经结束了，现在应该——","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满足的船员","text":"后面那位先生，别藏着了，过来，我们好好谈谈。","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"……？","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":365},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满足的船员","text":"我要和你谈，这地方你说了才算，我清楚。","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"……谈判是证裁官的职责。你们该找西尔弗阁下。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"……","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"dialog","id":376},{"type":"charslot","id":377},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_bg_57_g11_meetingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":379},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":380,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":384},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你在这里等了我多久，小哈？","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我从早上就在了。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"蒂奇没有和你说吗？我有些私事要去办。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"在您身边，我从没见您为私事发过愁。我以为……船队里的事已经将您的生活全部占据。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"谁说不是呢？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你来找我是为了？","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"如果……我们不用出海也能有其他出路的话，您愿意放弃罗盘吗？","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你打算怎么做？先说说看。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"那些从雅隆逃回来的人说，如果我们交出罗盘与窃贼，就能得到赦免，可以在镇子定居，想去别的地方他们也不会阻拦。","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你相信了？","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我核实了。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"什么时候？我怎么不知道？","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"您还在养伤，我不想打扰。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"……你不必这样为我着想的。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"您养育我长大，是我应该的。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"一转眼，你的个子都比我高了。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"小时候我总在祈祷，祈祷自己能快点长大，长高一点，强壮一点，这样就能为胡安娜女士分担更多烦恼。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"现在看来，也算如愿了。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"不论你长多大，在我心里都还是个孩子。","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"那我的想法呢？是否在您眼中，那依然是一个孩子的想法？","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"……","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"不，小哈，那可不是孩子的想法，是成人的软弱妥协。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"我宁可死都不愿向他们投降……","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"小哈，那些和你一起长大的伙伴，死在他们手中的又有多少？","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我忘不了，胡安娜女士……","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"至今我都铭记在心，最艰难的岁月里，我和我的船员们如何帮助他们！","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"是科鲁兹与我带着自己的船员为他们驱赶前来侵扰的海嗣！","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"是我们省出为数不多的口粮，好让他们不必去啃食同类的尸体！","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"可他们呢！等审判庭一来，他们又毫不留情将我们赶进盐漠深处！","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"如果不是他们见死不救，科鲁兹又怎会沦落到那个境地！","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"我绝不会向那些忘恩负义的东西低头……","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"我爱你们所有人，小哈，不论你是否相信，就像我爱当年与我一起在海浪中拼杀的伙伴。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"虽然他们早已逝去，从你们这些孩子的脸上，我还能依稀看到他们的模样。这让我不禁感叹，来自血脉的传承是多么神奇的事情。","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"所以我无法原谅……请你理解，小哈。","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":448},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":449},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":451},{"type":"charslot","id":452},{"type":"background","id":453},{"type":"image","id":454}],"characters":["极境","伊西多","门外的船员","好奇的船员","探头的船员","好奇的路人","不屑的路人","小伊西多","冷漠的路人","害羞的孩子","好心的路人","帕斯卡拉","饥饿的船员","习武教士","西尔弗","安纳斯塔西奥","满足的船员","胡安娜","哈维尔"]}